@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<body>
    <div class="content-wrapper mt-5">
        <h1 class="roboto-black">Our Privacy Policy</h1>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
            Sustain Wear collects only the information necessary to facilitate the
            distribution of donated clothing to our partner charitable organizations.
            This may include your name, contact details, donation records, and any logistical
            information required for coordinating pickups, drop-offs, or volunteer activities.
            We do not collect excessive or unrelated data, and we do not disclose or sell personal
            information for marketing or commercial purposes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-3">Use of Personal Information</h2>
        <p>
            Personal information is used solely to support our operational activities,
            including coordinating donation logistics, communicating with donors and
            volunteers, and maintaining accurate internal documentation. Sustain Wear
            may share limited, relevant information with trusted partner charities strictly
            for purposes related to donation distribution. All data sharing is restricted to
            what is essential to fulfill our charitable mission.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-3 font">Data Protection and Individual Rights</h2>
        <p>

            Sustain Wear employs reasonable administrative, technical, and physical
            safeguards to protect personal information from unauthorized access,
            misuse, or loss. Individuals have the right to request access to, correction
            of, or deletion of their personal data in accordance with applicable privacy laws.
            Requests may be submitted through our designated contact channels and will be addressed
            in a timely and compliant manner.
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
